<!--
  Source-onboarding copy, shared by Android (:app) and iOS (:shared) through Compose Multiplatform
  resources. Values are copied verbatim from app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml — the :app copies
  remain for the surfaces that have not moved into this module yet, so any edit here must be
  mirrored there (and vice versa) until the last :app consumer is gone.

  Every translatable key here MUST also exist in values-bg/ and values-es/. These resources are
  packaged into both hosts and resolved against the system locale, so a key that only lives in
  values/ renders English to Bulgarian and Spanish users on Android as well as iOS. Enforced by
  the root `checkTranslations` task; proper nouns opt out with translatable="false", matching
  app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml.
-->
